              "type": "text",
              "id": "jaI1a",
              "name": "Intro",
              "fill": "#4A4943",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 880,
              "content": "An ability on cooldown: an hourglass in a rounded tile, the shape of a League spell icon. Green sand on top is what you kept, red sand at the bottom is what you pay in reps. The wordmark is Barlow Condensed ExtraBold Italic, “.LOL” in green. Components: Logo / Mark and Logo / Lockup.",
