              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Hover and pressed add a state layer in the control's content colour: 8 % on hover, 12 % while pressed. Filled and outlined buttons also shrink to 97 % while pressed. Keyboard focus draws a 2 px focus-ring outside the shape; disabled controls drop to 40 % opacity. Hover and press ease out over 100 ms, switches and card expansion over 200 ms. Buttons, icon buttons and links live in “Controls library” with one reusable instance per state; this table covers the composite controls.",
