                "NV3FX/cU3ej": {
                  "fill": "$text-primary"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "WMg6m",
              "name": "History refresh behaviour",
              "width": 420,
              "height": 120,
              "content": "History refresh (right end of the History title row). The label says when History was last read from the League client (\"Updated just now\", \"Updated 2 min ago\", \"Updated 2 h ago\"), updated every minute. The button re-reads the client's match history now. Updating: label \"Updating…\", button disabled. Offline (no client): button disabled, label kept. Also runs on its own at connection and when a game ends. Hover: Icon button state layer."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
